            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a medical device, comprising a shaft including a distal end including a passive electrode that defines a central opening extending through the passive electrode, an active electrode within the central opening, wherein the active electrode is movable between at least: an extended position in which the active electrode does not contact the passive electrode, and a retracted position in which the active electrode contacts the passive electrode.</p>
            </abstract>
